      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I encountered this exact bug as well, and after hours of googling and tinkering with settings, I figured out that it is caused by conflicts with memory virtualization regarding EasyAntiCheat and Hyper-V. The only fix to this bug is to disable Hyper-V in Windows Features and prevent Hyper-V from running at boot (bcdedit /set hypervisorlaunchtype off).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
